1
00:00:00,117 --> 00:00:01,487
(Howard:)Because no one from the future

2
00:00:01,485 --> 00:00:03,615
(Howard:)has come back to kill us.

3
00:00:05,456 --> 00:00:06,826
(Leonard:)Very funny.

4
00:00:06,824 --> 00:00:08,254
(Howard:)You got something better?

5
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:09,588
(Leonard:)Well, not really.

6
00:00:09,593 --> 00:00:11,193
(Howard:)Okay, then.

7
00:00:12,763 --> 00:00:14,763
(toilet flushes)

8
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,370
(Howard:)Geez, how much wine
did you drink?

9
00:00:18,368 --> 00:00:22,108
(Leonard:)Not a lot. I just couldn't
start until you walked away.

10
00:00:25,476 --> 00:00:28,176
(Sheldon:)The Hell Prawn lunges
out of the hot spring!

11
00:00:28,178 --> 00:00:29,178
(die clinks)

12
00:00:29,179 --> 00:00:31,479
(Sheldon:)You block it with your shield.

13
00:00:31,482 --> 00:00:32,482
(Sheldon:)Do you attack?

14
00:00:32,483 --> 00:00:33,613
(Bernadette:)Does it have eyes?

15
00:00:33,617 --> 00:00:36,147
(Sheldon:)Three giant red ones
and they never blink.

16
00:00:36,153 --> 00:00:37,783
(Sheldon:)It's unsettling.

17
00:00:37,788 --> 00:00:40,318
I stab it in the middle eye!

18
00:00:40,324 --> 00:00:41,624
(die clinks)

19
00:00:41,625 --> 00:00:42,625
Good choice!

20
00:00:42,626 --> 00:00:44,226
Critical hit!
Your sword goes

21
00:00:44,228 --> 00:00:46,398
(Sheldon:)through its eye
into its tiny brain.

22
00:00:46,396 --> 00:00:48,696
(Sheldon:)With its final dying gasp,
it says,

23
00:00:48,699 --> 00:00:50,229
(high-pitched voice):
“You have reduced me

24
00:00:50,234 --> 00:00:52,164
“to a pile of sushi.

25
00:00:52,169 --> 00:00:53,839
“Enjoy me

26
00:00:53,837 --> 00:00:56,767
“with this packet of soy sauce.

27
00:00:56,773 --> 00:01:01,023
It's low sodium.” (groans)

